omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vx5aB1hLPlAQ7kNvwGapodp&_nc_oc=AdpSHkxS0ETC4KswVDbT0fmXvlsgG-qGw6vhZwd1ACRSvs-wdK_kFzwdHKGPNy-SnYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFV8w52rMaDIp9b1ZEsWmC6iypMOunmgJ_NY03yymIpiA&oe=6A95D474"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aVM6sCv0QqEQ7kNvwFywQ3K&_nc_oc=AdqwzmhCqY3EvGyAr6EXov1Nb49E-0CBrYy2-B6CAShRy7R-1kpEMlaWrdwu6vqhiJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQELop22Ocqt52-GxVz49MFO5LhhY-wgsTS_wFg04yTJYA&oe=6A95D5D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zV1YxhWFSoYQ7kNvwEbjSJM&_nc_oc=AdrLX4hpBpPKN62t9X9Rm_4xkeafHGODniJFRfmjhi1t7L1eINfY_x8pcKAV-cWs1Vg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEACQJyqDHJm991sg-F7v7dpDlgHwdZf7Zgj-UrMpZB0g&oe=6A95B2B7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://